    "description": {
      "content": "The Discord Interactions API enables applications to create and respond to application commands (slash commands), message components, and modals. It supports both Gateway-based and webhook-based interaction handling, allowing bots to build rich, interactive user experiences within Discord.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Discord Support\n Email: support@discord.com",
